 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508099,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Suppose one day Joe filled 83 buckets; how much money would he make on that day?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Joe is paid $2.50 for each bucket.</p>\n<p>Joe filled 83 buckets.</p>\n<p>Set up the two ratios as proportions to answer this question.</p>\n<p>Let <i>x</i> = the amount of money earned.</p>\n<p>It helps many students to create a table to help set up their ratios.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>Conversion</td>\n<td>What I have or want</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>buckets</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>83</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dollars</td>\n<td>$2.50</td>\n<td><i>x</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Set up your proportion.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{2.50}} = \\frac{{83}}{x}\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = \\left( {2.50} \\right)\\left( {83} \\right)\"></span></td>\n<td>Cross multiply.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = 207.50\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Joe earned $207.50.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$207.50 "
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
